<title>UK: LME copper moves sideways above $2,400 in PM rings.</title>
<headline>LME copper moves sideways above $2,400 in PM rings.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Settles at unchanged levels above $2,400. Cash/threes steady at $57/$59 backwardation.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Weaker despite stocks fall, support seen at $1,650.</p>
<p>LEAD - Hovers above $615 lows. ZINC - Barely softer.</p>
<p>TIN - Slightly lower above $5,700.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Off lows, back above $7,700.</p>
</text>
